WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,320
I will never ride in the car you drive again

2
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:05,630
Is this such an exaggeration?

3
00:00:11,040 --> 00:00:13,610
It’s amazing Xiao Li

4
00:00:13,770 --> 00:00:14,810
Free up the maintenance area

5
00:00:14,810 --> 00:00:23,420
I want to personally inspect Mr. Wang’s car and I’ve finished looking at it. If you’re interested, we’ll negotiate the price. Sorry, sorry.

6
00:00:23,420 --> 00:00:27,300
When I see a good car, I get easily excited and go to the office to discuss the price.

7
00:00:30,050 --> 00:00:31,090
If I ask you

8
00:00:31,090 --> 00:00:32,530
How did you repair this car?

9
00:00:32,890 --> 00:00:34,370
I guess you won't tell me either

10
00:00:36,820 --> 00:00:39,020
The current first-generation red star with good quality

11
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:41,860
The market price is about 2.2 million
